Table full name: bigquery-public-data.sec_quarterly_financials.submission
Column name: submission_number Type: STRING Description: Accession Number. The 20-character string formed from the 18-digit number assigned by the Commission to each EDGAR submission. submission_number: [adsh]
Column name: central_index_key Type: INT64 Description: Central Index Key (CIK). Ten digit number assigned by the Commission to each registrant that submits filings. central_index_key: [cik]
Column name: company_name Type: STRING Description: Name of registrant. This corresponds to the name of the legal entity as recorded in EDGAR as of the filing date. company_name: [name]
Column name: sic Type: STRING Description: Standard Industrial Classification (SIC). Four digit code assigned by the Commission as of the filing date, indicating the registrant's type of business.
Column name: countryba Type: STRING Description: The ISO 3166-1 country of the registrant's business address.
Column name: stprba Type: STRING Description: The state or province of the registrant's business address, if field countryba is US or CA.
Column name: cityba Type: STRING Description: The city of the registrant's business address.
Column name: zipba Type: STRING Description: The zip code of the registrant's business address.
Column name: ba_street1 Type: STRING Description: The first line of the street of the registrant's business address. ba_street1: [bas1]
Column name: ba_street2 Type: STRING Description: The second line of the street of the registrant's business address. ba_street2: [bas2]
Column name: ba_phone Type: STRING Description: The phone number of the registrant's business address. ba_phone: [baph]
Column name: countryma Type: STRING Description: The ISO 3166-1 country of the registrant's mailing address.
Column name: stprma Type: STRING Description: The state or province of the registrant's mailing address, if field countryma is US or CA.
Column name: cityma Type: STRING Description: The city of the registrant's mailing address.
Column name: zipma Type: STRING Description: The zip code of the registrant's mailing address.
Column name: ma_street1 Type: STRING Description: The first line of the street of the registrant's mailing address. ma_street1: [mas1]
Column name: ma_street2 Type: STRING Description: The second line of the street of the registrant's mailing address. ma_street2: [mas2]
Column name: country_inc Type: STRING Description: The country of incorporation for the registrant. country_inc: [countryinc]
Column name: state_province_inc Type: STRING Description: The state or province of incorporation for the registrant, if countryinc is US or CA, otherwise NULL. state_province_inc: [stprinc]
Column name: ein Type: STRING Description: Employee Identification Number, 9 digit identification number assigned by the Internal Revenue Service to business entities operating in the United States.
Column name: former_name Type: STRING Description: Most recent former name of the registrant, if any. former_name: [former]
Column name: date_changed Type: INT64 Description: Date of change from the former name, if any. date_changed: [changed]
Column name: filer_status Type: STRING Description: Filer status with the Commission at the time of submission: 1-LAF=Large Accelerated, 2-ACC=Accelerated, 3-SRA=Smaller Reporting Accelerated, 4-NON=Non-Accelerated, 5-SML=Smaller Reporting Filer, NULL=not assigned. filer_status: [afs]
Column name: well_known_seasoned_issuer Type: BOOL Description: Well Known Seasoned Issuer (WKSI). An issuer that meets specific Commission requirements at some point during a 60-day period preceding the date the issuer satisfies its obligation to update its shelf registration statement. well_known_seasoned_issuer: [wksi]
Column name: fiscal_year_end Type: STRING Description: Fiscal Year End Date. fiscal_year_end: [fye]
Column name: form Type: STRING Description: The submission type of the registrant's filing.
Column name: period Type: INT64 Description: Balance Sheet Date.
Column name: fiscal_year Type: INT64 Description: Fiscal Year Focus (as defined in EFM Ch. 6). fiscal_year: [fy]
Column name: fiscal_period_focus Type: STRING Description: Fiscal Period Focus (as defined in EFM Ch. 6) within Fiscal Year. The 10-Q for the 1st, 2nd and 3rd quarters would have a fiscal period focus of Q1, Q2 (or H1), and Q3 (or M9) respectively, and a 10-K would have a fiscal period focus of FY. fiscal_period_focus: [fp]
Column name: date_filed Type: INT64 Description: The date of the registrant's filing with the Commission. date_filed: [filed]
Column name: date_accepted Type: TIMESTAMP Description: The acceptance date and time of the registrant's filing with the Commission. Filings accepted after 5:30pm EST are considered filed on the following business day. date_accepted: [accepted]
Column name: has_previous_report Type: BOOL Description: Previous Report.  TRUE indicates that the submission information was subsequently amended prior to the end cutoff date of the data set. "has_previous_report: [prevrpt]
Column name: has_required_detail Type: BOOL Description: TRUE indicates that the XBRL submission contains quantitative disclosures within the footnotes and schedules at the required detail level (e.g., each amount). has_required_detail: [detail]
Column name: instance Type: STRING Description: The name of the submitted XBRL Instance Document (EX-101.INS) type data file. The name often begins with the company ticker symbol.
Column name: num_ciks Type: INT64 Description: Number of Central Index Keys (CIK) of registrants (i.e., business units) included in the consolidating entity's submitted filing. num_ciks: [nciks]
Column name: additional_ciks Type: STRING Description: Additional CIKs of co-registrants included in a consolidating entity's EDGAR submission, separated by spaces. If there are no other co-registrants (i.e., nciks = 1), the value of aciks is NULL. For a very small number of filers, the list of co-registrants is too long to fit in the field. Where this is the case, PARTIAL will appear at the end of the list indicating that not all co-registrants' CIKs are included in the field; users should refer to the complete submission file for all CIK information. additional_ciks: [aciks]
Column name: public_float_usd Type: FLOAT64 Description: Public float, in USD, if provided in this submission. public_float_usd: [pubfloatusd]
Column name: float_date Type: INT64 Description: Date on which the public float was measured by the filer. float_date: [floatdate]
Column name: float_axis Type: STRING Description: If the public float value was computed by summing across several tagged values, this indicates the nature of the summation. float_axis: [floataxis]
Column name: float_terms Type: INT64 Description: If the public float was computed, the number of terms in the summation. float_terms: [floatmems]
Column name: _PARTITIONTIME Type: TIMESTAMP
